## Business Scenario

A multinational company receives operational events from multiple systems:

ERP Orders
Logistics Tracking
Inventory Updates
Payment Transactions
Customer Service Events
Supplier Updates
Warehouse IoT Sensors
CRM Events

The platform must:

Ingest ~2M+ events/day (simulated)
Process events in near real time (<15 min latency)
Guarantee data quality and exactly-once semantics
Maintain Bronze/Silver/Gold layers
Provide business dashboards
Be production-ready with monitoring and CI/CD

